# CI lockfile input — pins the full test/lint environment for reproducible CI.
# Compile: .venv/bin/pip-compile --allow-unsafe requirements-lock.in \
#              -o requirements-lock.txt --strip-extras
# Keep ranges in sync with pyproject.toml; Dependabot refreshes the output.
#
# --allow-unsafe is required: setuptools is pinned below, and pip-compile
# otherwise drops it into the trailing "considered to be unsafe" comment
# block instead of emitting a pin. An unpinned setuptools is exactly how
# PYSEC-2026-3447 kept reaching CI (see the setuptools note below).
